06\", label: \"GANs published\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"Goodfellow et al. introduce Generative Adversarial Networks.\"},\n      {date: \"2014-09\", label: \"Seq2Seq + Attention\", significance: \"medium\", detail: \"Bahdanau attention mechanism enables neural machine translation breakthroughs.\"},\n      {date: \"2015-12\", label: \"ResNet (152 layers)\", significance: \"medium\", detail: \"Residual connections enable training very deep networks. Superhuman on ImageNet.\"},\n      {date: \"2016-03\", label: \"AlphaGo defeats Lee Sedol\", significance: \"critical\", detail: \"DeepMind's Go AI wins 4-1 against world champion. Global media event.\"},\n      {date: \"2017-06\", label: \"Transformer architecture\", significance: \"critical\", detail: \"'Attention Is All You Need' — foundation of all modern LLMs.\"},\n      {date: \"2018-06\", label: \"GPT-1 (117M params)\", significance: \"medium\", detail: \"OpenAI demonstrates unsupervised pre-training + fine-tuning paradigm.\"},\n      {date: \"2018-10\", label: \"BERT\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"Bidirectional pre-training dominates NLP benchmarks. Google deploys in Search.\"},\n      {date: \"2020-05\", label: \"GPT-3 (175B params)\", significance: \"critical\", detail: \"Few-shot learning without fine-tuning. Demonstrates emergence of capabilities at scale.\"},\n      {date: \"2021-01\", label: \"DALL-E & CLIP\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"Text-to-image generation and vision-language understanding.\"},\n      {date: \"2022-04\", label: \"PaLM (540B params)\", significance: \"medium\", detail: \"Google's large model shows chain-of-thought reasoning capabilities.\"},\n      {date: \"2023-03\", label: \"GPT-4\", significance: \"critical\", detail: \"Multimodal LLM passes bar exam (90th percentile), SAT (99th percentile).\"},\n      {date: \"2024-02\", label: \"Gemini 1.5 (1M context)\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"Million-token context window enables new application paradigms.\"},\n      {date: \"2024-09\", label: \"o1 reasoning model\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"Chain-of-thought at inference time. PhD-level reasoning on benchmarks.\"},\n      {date: \"2025-02\", label: \"Claude 3.5 / GPT-4.5\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"Frontier models achieve near-human performance on most professional tasks.\"}\n    ];\n\n    var industryData = [\n      {date: \"2011-10\", label: \"Siri launches\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"Apple ships first mainstream voice assistant on iPhone 4S.\"},\n      {date: \"2014-11\", label: \"Amazon Echo / Alexa\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"Voice AI enters the home. 100M+ units sold by 2020.\"},\n      {date: \"2016-09\", label: \"Google Translate goes neural\", significance: \"medium\", detail: \"NMT replaces phrase-based MT. Translation quality jumps dramatically.\"},\n      {date: \"2018-05\", label: \"Google Duplex demo\", significance: \"medium\", detail: \"AI makes phone calls to book appointments. Raises ethical questions.\"},\n      {date: \"2020-06\", label: \"GPT-3 API launches\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"First commercial large language model API. Spawns thousands of AI startups.\"},\n      {date: \"2021-06\", label: \"GitHub Copilot preview\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"AI pair programming goes mainstream. 1M+ developers by 2022.\"},\n      {date: \"2022-08\", label: \"Stable Diffusion open-sourced\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"Text-to-image AI becomes freely available. Disrupts creative industries.\"},\n      {date: \"2022-11\", label: \"ChatGPT launches\", significance: \"critical\", detail: \"100M users in 2 months — fastest consumer app adoption in history.\"},\n      {date: \"2023-02\", label: \"Microsoft Bing + GPT-4\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"AI integrated into search. Triggers Google's 'code red' and Bard launch.\"},\n      {date: \"2023-07\", label: \"Meta releases Llama 2\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"Open-source LLM competitive with proprietary models. Democratizes access.\"},\n      {date: \"2024-01\", label: \"AI agents in enterprise\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"Salesforce, ServiceNow, SAP ship AI agent products. Enterprise adoption accelerates.\"},\n      {date: \"2024-05\", label: \"OpenAI GPT-4o\", significance: \"medium\", detail: \"Real-time multimodal interaction. Voice, vision, text unified.\"},\n      {date: \"2025-01\", label: \"AI coding agents mainstream\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"Cursor, Claude Code, Copilot Workspace — AI writes majority of new code at top companies.\"}\n    ];\n\n    var regulationData = [\n      {date: \"2016-10\", label: \"Obama White House AI report\", significance: \"medium\", detail: \"First major US government report on AI policy implications.\"},\n      {date: \"2018-04\", label: \"EU GDPR takes effect\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"Not AI-specific but includes 'right to explanation' for automated decisions.\"},\n      {date: \"2019-04\", label: \"EU AI Ethics Guidelines\", significance: \"medium\", detail: \"High-Level Expert Group publishes 'Trustworthy AI' framework. Non-binding.\"},\n      {date: \"2020-02\", label: \"EU AI White Paper\", significance: \"medium\", detail: \"European Commission proposes risk-based regulatory framework for AI.\"},\n      {date: \"2021-04\", label: \"EU AI Act proposed\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"First comprehensive AI regulation. Risk-based tiers: unacceptable/high/limited/minimal.\"},\n      {date: \"2022-10\", label: \"US AI Bill of Rights\", significance: \"medium\", detail: \"White House blueprint for AI rights. Non-binding framework.\"},\n      {date: \"2023-05\", label: \"EU AI Act agreed\", significance: \"critical\", detail: \"European Parliament approves AI Act with last-minute generative AI provisions.\"},\n      {date: \"2023-07\", label: \"White House voluntary commitments\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"7 leading AI companies (OpenAI, Google, Meta, etc.) sign safety commitments.\"},\n      {date: \"2023-10\", label: \"Biden Executive Order on AI\", significance: \"critical\", detail: \"Most significant US AI policy action. Safety testing, watermarking, federal use standards.\"},\n      {date: \"2023-11\", label: \"Bletchley Declaration\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"28 countries + EU sign declaration on AI safety at UK AI Safety Summit.\"},\n      {date: \"2024-03\", label: \"EU AI Act enacted\", significance: \"critical\", detail: \"World's first comprehensive AI law. Compliance deadlines begin 2025-2027.\"},\n      {date: \"2024-11\", label: \"California SB 1047 signed\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"First major US state-level AI safety legislation.\"},\n      {date: \"2025-02\", label: \"EU AI Act enforcement begins\", significance: \"high\", detail: \"First tier of EU AI Act obligations take effect. Banned practices enforced.\"}\n    ];\n\n    var investmentData = [\n      {year: 2010, investment: 1.3}, {year: 2011, investment: 1.9}, {year: 2012, investment: 2.5},\n      {year: 2013, investment: 3.2}, {year: 2014, investment: 5.5}, {year: 2015, investment: 8.5},\n      {year: 2016, investment: 12.2}, {year: 2017, investment: 18.5}, {year: 2018, investment: 28.4},\n      {year: 2019, investment: 32.1}, {year: 2020, investment: 36.5}, {year: 2021, investment: 52.8},\n      {year: 2022, investment: 48.2}, {year: 2023, investment: 67.2}, {year: 2024, investment: 95.8},\n      {year: 2025, investment: 120.5}\n    ];\n\n    // ===== BUILD TIMELINE WITH D3 =====\n    var chartsBuilt = false;\n\n    function buildTimeline() {\n      var container = document.getElementById('timelineContainer');\n      var containerWidth = container.clientWidth - 48; // minus padding\n      var margin = {top: 60, right: 60, bottom: 40, left: 110};\n      var width = containerWidth - margin.left - margin.right;\n      var trackHeight = 100;\n      var trackGap = 24;\n      var height = 3 * trackHeight + 2 * trackGap + margin.top + margin.bottom;\n\n      // Remove old SVG\n      d3.select('#timelineContainer svg').remove();\n\n      var svg = d3.select('#timelineContainer')\n        .append('svg')\n        .attr('width', containerWidth)\n        .attr('height', height)\n        .style('overflow', 'visible');\n\n      var g = svg.append('g').attr('transform', 'translate(' + margin.left + ',' + margin.top + ')');\n\n      var isDark = document.documentElement.classList.contains('theme-dark');\n      var textSecondary = isDark ? '#888' : '#64748b';\n      var borderColor = isDark ? 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)' : 'rgba(0,0,0,0.06)';\n      var trackResearch = isDark ? '#3b82f6' : '#2563eb';\n      var trackIndustry = isDark ? '#8b5cf6' : '#7c3aed';\n      var trackRegulation = isDark ? '#f59e0b' : '#d97706';\n      var chatgptColor = isDark ? '#f43f5e' : '#e11d48';\n      var surfaceColor = isDark ? '#141414' : '#FFFFFF';\n\n      // Scales\n      var xScale = d3.scaleLinear().domain([2010, 2025.5]).range([0, width]);\n\n      // Track positions\n      var tracks = [\n        {name: 'Research', y: 0, color: trackResearch, data: researchData},\n        {name: 'Industry', y: trackHeight + trackGap, color: trackIndustry, data: industryData},\n        {name: 'Regulation', y: 2*(trackHeight + trackGap), color: trackRegulation, data: regulationData}\n      ];\n\n      // X axis - year lines\n      var yearValues = [2010, 2011, 2012, 2013, 2014, 2015, 2016, 2017, 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025];\n      g.selectAll('.year-line')\n        .data(yearValues)\n        .enter().append('line')\n        .attr('x1', function(d) { return xScale(d); })\n        .attr('x2', function(d) { return xScale(d); })\n        .attr('y1', -10)\n        .attr('y2', 3*trackHeight + 2*trackGap + 10)\n        .attr('stroke', borderColor)\n        .attr('stroke-width', 1);\n\n      // Year labels\n      g.selectAll('.year-label')\n        .data(yearValues.filter(function(d) { return d % 2 === 0 || d >= 2022; }))\n        .enter().append('text')\n        .attr('x', function(d) { return xScale(d); })\n        .attr('y', -24)\n        .attr('text-anchor', 'middle')\n        .attr('fill', textSecondary)\n        .attr('font-size', '11px')\n        .attr('font-family', 'Inter, sans-serif')\n        .text(function(d) { return d; });\n\n      // Track backgrounds\n      tracks.forEach(function(track) {\n        g.append('rect')\n          .attr('x', 0).attr('y', track.y)\n          .attr('width', width).attr('height', trackHeight)\n          .attr('rx', 6)\n          .attr('fill', track.color)\n          .attr('opacity', 0.04);\n\n        // Track label\n        g.append('text')\n          .attr('x', -16)\n          .attr('y', track.y + trackHeight/2 + 4)\n          .attr('text-anchor', 'end')\n          .attr('fill', track.color)\n          .attr('font-size', '13px')\n          .attr('font-weight', '600')\n          .attr('font-family', 'Inter, sans-serif')\n          .text(track.name);\n\n        // Track baseline\n        g.append('line')\n          .attr('x1', 0).attr('x2', width)\n          .attr('y1', track.y + trackHeight).attr('y2', track.y + trackHeight)\n          .attr('stroke', borderColor);\n      });\n\n      // ChatGPT inflection line\n      var chatgptX = xScale(2022 + 10/12); // Nov 2022\n      g.append('line')\n        .attr('x1', chatgptX).attr('x2', chatgptX)\n        .attr('y1', -40).attr('y2', 3*trackHeight + 2*trackGap + 10)\n        .attr('stroke', chatgptColor)\n        .attr('stroke-width', 2)\n        .attr('stroke-dasharray', '6 4')\n        .attr('opacity', 0.6);\n\n      g.append('text')\n        .attr('x', chatgptX + 6)\n        .attr('y', -30)\n        .attr('fill', chatgptColor)\n        .attr('font-size', '11px')\n        .attr('font-weight', '600')\n        .attr('font-family', 'Inter, sans-serif')\n        .attr('text-transform', 'uppercase')\n        .attr('letter-spacing', '0.05em')\n        .text('ChatGPT — Nov 2022');\n\n      // Density shading: 2023-2024 region\n      var densityStart = xScale(2023);\n      var densityEnd = xScale(2025);\n      g.append('rect')\n        .attr('x', densityStart).attr('y', -10)\n        .attr('width', densityEnd - densityStart).attr('height', 3*trackHeight + 2*trackGap + 20)\n        .attr('fill', chatgptColor)\n        .attr('opacity', 0.03)\n        .attr('rx', 4);\n\n      // Lag annotation: Transformer → ChatGPT\n      var transformerX = xScale(2017 + 5/12);\n      var lagY = -6;\n      g.append('line')\n        .attr('x1', transformerX).attr('x2', chatgptX)\n        .attr('y1', lagY).attr('y2', lagY)\n        .attr('stroke', textSecondary)\n        .attr('stroke-width', 1)\n        .attr('marker-end', 'url(#arrowhead)');\n\n      g.append('text')\n        .attr('x', (transformerX + chatgptX) / 2)\n        .attr('y', lagY - 4)\n        .attr('text-anchor', 'middle')\n        .attr('fill', textSecondary)\n        .attr('font-size', '9px')\n        .attr('font-family', 'Inter, sans-serif')\n        .text('5.4 yr lag');\n\n      // Arrowhead marker\n      svg.append('defs').append('marker')\n        .attr('id', 'arrowhead')\n        .attr('viewBox', '0 0 10 10')\n        .attr('refX', 10).attr('refY', 5)\n        .attr('markerWidth', 6).attr('markerHeight', 6)\n        .attr('orient', 'auto')\n        .append('path')\n        .attr('d', 'M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z')\n        .attr('fill', textSecondary);\n\n      // Helper: parse date to year.fraction\n      function parseDate(dateStr) {\n        var parts = dateStr.split('-');\n        var year = parseInt(parts[0]);\n        var month = parseInt(parts[1]);\n        return year + (month - 1) / 12;\n      }\n\n      // Significance sizes\n      var sigSize = {critical: 9, high: 6, medium: 4};\n\n      // Tooltip\n      var tooltip = document.getElementById('tooltip');\n\n      // Plot milestones\n      tracks.forEach(function(track) {\n        // Use a simple y-position jitter to avoid overlaps\n        var positioned = track.data.map(function(d) {\n          return {\n            date: d.date,\n            label: d.label,\n            significance: d.significance,\n            detail: d.detail,\n            xVal: parseDate(d.date),\n            size: sigSize[d.significance] || 4\n          };\n        });\n\n        // Sort by xVal for collision detection\n        positioned.sort(function(a, b) { return a.xVal - b.xVal; });\n\n        // Assign y positions within the track to avoid overlaps\n        var yRows = [];\n        positioned.forEach(function(d) {\n          var xPos = xScale(d.xVal);\n          var row = 0;\n          var placed = false;\n          while (!placed) {\n            var overlap = false;\n            for (var i = 0; i < yRows.length; i++) {\n              if (yRows[i].row === row && Math.abs(yRows[i].xPos - xPos) < 60) {\n                overlap = true;\n                break;\n              }\n            }\n            if (!overlap) {\n              d.row = row;\n              yRows.push({row: row, xPos: xPos});\n              placed = true;\n            }\n            row++;\n            if (row > 2) {\n              d.row = 0;\n              yRows.push({row: 0, xPos: xPos});\n              placed = true;\n            }\n          }\n        });\n\n        positioned.forEach(function(d) {\n          var cx = xScale(d.xVal);\n          var cy = track.y + 20 + d.row * 32;\n          if (cy > track.y + trackHeight - 10) cy = track.y + trackHeight - 10;\n\n          // Glow for critical\n          if (d.significance === 'critical') {\n            g.append('circle')\n              .attr('cx', cx).attr('cy', cy)\n              .attr('r', d.size + 6)\n              .attr('fill', track.color)\n              .attr('opacity', 0.15);\n          }\n\n          // Dot\n          g.append('circle')\n            .attr('cx', cx).attr('cy', cy)\n            .attr('r', d.size)\n            .attr('fill', track.color)\n            .attr('class', 'milestone-dot')\n            .attr('stroke', surfaceColor)\n            .attr('stroke-width', 2)\n            .on('mouseenter', function(event) {\n              var sigColors = {critical: chatgptColor, high: track.color, medium: textSecondary};\n              var sigBg = {critical: isDark ? 'rgba(244,63,94,0.15)' : 'rgba(225,29,72,0.12)', high: isDark ? 'rgba(255,255,255,0.08)' : 'rgba(0,0,0,0.06)', medium: isDark ? 'rgba(255,255,255,0.05)' : 'rgba(0,0,0,0.04)'};\n              tooltip.innerHTML = '<div class=\"tt-date\">' + d.date + '</div>' +\n                '<div class=\"tt-label\" style=\"color:' + track.color + '\">' + d.label + '</div>' +\n                '<div class=\"tt-detail\">' + d.detail + '</div>' +\n                '<span class=\"tt-sig\" style=\"background:' + sigBg[d.significance] + ';color:' + sigColors[d.significance] + '\">' + d.significance + '</span>';\n              var rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();\n              tooltip.style.left = (event.clientX - rect.left + 12) + 'px';\n              tooltip.style.top = (event.clientY - rect.top - 10) + 'px';\n              tooltip.classList.add('show');\n            })\n            .on('mouseleave', function() {\n              tooltip.classList.remove('show');\n            });\n\n          // Label\n          g.append('text')\n            .attr('x', cx)\n            .attr('y', cy - d.size - 5)\n            .attr('text-anchor', 'middle')\n            .attr('fill', isDark ? '#ccc' : '#444')\n            .attr('font-size', '9px')\n            .attr('font-family', 'Inter, sans-serif')\n            .attr('font-weight', d.significance === 'critical' ? '600' : '400')\n            .text(d.label.length > 18 ? d.label.substring(0, 17) + '…' : d.label);\n        });\n      });\n    }\n\n    // ===== BUILD INVESTMENT CHART =====\n    function buildInvestmentChart() {\n      if (typeof Chart === 'undefined') return;\n      var canvas = document.getElementById('investmentChart');\n      if (!canvas) return;\n\n      // Destroy existing\n      if (window.investChart) {\n        try { window.investChart.destroy(); } catch(e) {}\n      }\n\n      var isDark = document.documentElement.classList.contains('theme-dark');\n      var textColor = isDark ? '#888' : '#64748b';\n      var gridColor = isDark ? 'rgba(255,255,255,0.04)' : 'rgba(0,0,0,0.04)';\n      var lineColor = isDark ? '#10b981' : '#059669';\n      var fillColor = isDark ? 'rgba(16,185,129,0.12)' : 'rgba(5,150,105,0.1)';\n\n      var ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n      window.investChart = new Chart(ctx, {\n        type: 'line',\n        data: {\n          labels: investmentData.map(function(d) { return d.year; }),\n          datasets: [{\n            label: 'Global Private AI Investment ($B)',\n            data: investmentData.map(function(d) { return d.investment; }),\n            borderColor: lineColor,\n            backgroundColor: fillColor,\n            fill: true,\n            tension: 0.3,\n            pointRadius: 4,\n            pointBackgroundColor: lineColor,\n            pointBorderColor: isDark ? '#141414' : '#FFFFFF',\n            pointBorderWidth: 2,\n            pointHoverRadius: 7,\n            borderWidth: 2.5\n          }]\n        },\n        options: {\n          responsive: true,\n          maintainAspectRatio: false,\n          animation: false,\n          plugins: {\n            tooltip: {\n              enabled: true,\n              padding: 12,\n              cornerRadius: 8,\n              titleFont: { size: 13, family: 'Inter' },\n              bodyFont: { size: 12, family: 'Inter' },\n              callbacks: {\n                label: function(context) {\n                  return '$' + context.parsed.y + 'B';\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            legend: {\n              display: true,\n              labels: {\n                color: textColor,\n                font: { size: 12, family: 'Inter' },\n                boxWidth: 12,\n                boxHeight: 12,\n                borderRadius: 3\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          scales: {\n            x: {\n              ticks: { color: textColor, font: { size: 11, family: 'Inter' }, maxRotation: 0 },\n              grid: { color: gridColor, drawBorder: false }\n            },\n            y: {\n              ticks: {\n                color: textColor,\n                font: { size: 11, family: 'Inter' },\n                callback: function(value) { return '$' + value + 'B'; }\n              },\n              grid: { color: gridColor, drawBorder: false },\n              beginAtZero: true\n            }\n          },\n          layout: { padding: { top: 10, right: 20, bottom: 10, left: 10 } }\n        }\n      });\n    }\n\n    function onThemeChange() {\n      chartsBuilt = false;\n      buildTimeline();\n      buildInvestmentChart();\n    }\n\n    // Build on load\n    window.addEventListener('load', function() {\n      buildTimeline();\n      buildInvestmentChart();\n      chartsBuilt = true;\n    });\n\n    // Ensure all reveal elements are visible for PNG capture\n    setTimeout(function() {\n      document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(function(el) { el.classList.add('visible'); });\n    }, 500);\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n", "numLines": 464, "startLine": 360, "totalLines": 823}}

